    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MEGADEKA</strong> is a simulation game where you defend your base from a giant woman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At some point, the giant \u201cHer\u201d began living in this country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She crushes parts of the city beneath her feet and shakes the earth with her breathing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We must defend the city from Her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We must predict what She will do next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even today, I can see the giant Her sleeping from the window of the top-floor room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679390/extras/80c96aed3975978ee78fe836ed0fdeab.avif?t=1747837611\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simulation game where you defend your base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Predict the disasters caused by Her and choose objects inside the room accordingly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No quest markers or time limits\u2014you can play at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no visible stats; the situation is reflected by changes in the room\u2019s objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your score increases based on your actions\u2014aim for a high score by the end of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t make Her angry.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime:</strong> 30 to 60 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679390/extras/59f997f0ed806d09bff94331f51eab5e.avif?t=1747837611\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Streaming Guidelines</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both individuals and organizations may stream the game without permission.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MEGADEKA</strong> is a simulation game where you defend your base from a giant woman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At some point, the giant \u201cHer\u201d began living in this country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She crushes parts of the city beneath her feet and shakes the earth with her breathing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We must defend the city from Her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We must predict what She will do next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even today, I can see the giant Her sleeping from the window of the top-floor room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679390/extras/80c96aed3975978ee78fe836ed0fdeab.avif?t=1747837611\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simulation game where you defend your base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Predict the disasters caused by Her and choose objects inside the room accordingly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No quest markers or time limits\u2014you can play at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no visible stats; the situation is reflected by changes in the room\u2019s objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your score increases based on your actions\u2014aim for a high score by the end of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t make Her angry.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime:</strong> 30 to 60 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679390/extras/59f997f0ed806d09bff94331f51eab5e.avif?t=1747837611\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Streaming Guidelines</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both individuals and organizations may stream the game without permission.</p></li></ul>",
